    {
      "id": "LDyI3NnyGEn1nWwMyuZAq",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1565.5263295181683,
      "y": 1301.824017329086,
      "width": 584.9288985588606,
      "height": 184.36668815755914,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 973147421,
      "version": 1264,
      "versionNonce": 780080659,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779965731321,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    Redis Cache is there to prevent the same Company name\nbeing sent to the LLM multiple times. Instead, the company name\nis stored in redis \nwhile its being processed such that any subsequent requests can\npoll the cache \ninstead of waiting for fresh results\n\n",
      "fontSize": 18.4366688157559,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    Redis Cache is there to prevent the same Company name\nbeing sent to the LLM multiple times. Instead, the company name is stored in redis \nwhile its being processed such that any subsequent requests can poll the cache \ninstead of waiting for fresh results\n\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "Lnd2KyEMY6wh1ypi9UJPd",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1548.9063092368103,
      "y": 1088.7759784126936,
      "width": 698.4798583984375,
      "height": 75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0B",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1318193203,
      "version": 303,
      "versionNonce": 1059549203,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779965717714,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "    Rabbitmq is used to handle multiple requests of companies\nso that there is no bottleneck. Since the LLM_caller is a micro service, \nmore services are deployed based on the number of messages in queue",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "    Rabbitmq is used to handle multiple requests of companies\nso that there is no bottleneck. Since the LLM_caller is a micro service, \nmore services are deployed based on the number of messages in queue",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
